      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Been an issue for a while. \nFor now, a workaround is editing your locomotion layer to completely disable the walking animations when FBT is on.\nCreate a copy of the \"vrc_AvatarV3LocomotionLayer\" found in the SDK examples & create a state that's only active whenever TrackingType = 6. You can use the proxy_idle animation that's also from the examples folder. Slot that in as your Avatar's Locomotion and you should be good to go.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
